# reset-frames (H7): x2 at a=3; the row's reset click eases the curve from 3
# back to 1 on the spring while the box shows 1.00 from the first frame.
# The ported test pins 2.53 after 6 frames, 1.91 after 12, 1.02 after 43 and
# 1.00 after 61: frames at 0, 100, 200, 700 and 1000 ms after the click.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=3
wait 2000
click 254 450.5
shot reset-f0
frames reset-f100 every 100 for 100
frames reset-f200 every 100 for 100
frames reset-f700 every 500 for 500
frames reset-f1000 every 300 for 300
